doctype html
html(lang='zh-CN')
    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no')
        meta(name='description', content='张楠楠的个人主页，展示 AI Agent、Python、GitHub API 与 HarmonyOS 项目实践。')
        meta(name='author', content='张楠楠')
        title 张楠楠 | AI Agent 与 Python 开发

        link(rel='icon', type='image/x-icon', href='assets/favicon.ico')
        include includes/css.pug

    body.d-flex.flex-column.h-100
        main.flex-shrink-0
            include includes/navbar.pug

            header.hero-section.py-5
                .container.px-5.py-lg-5
                    .row.gx-5.align-items-center
                        .col-xxl-6
                            .text-center.text-xxl-start
                                .badge.bg-gradient-primary-to-secondary.text-white.mb-4.px-3.py-2
                                    .text-uppercase AI Agent &middot; Python &middot; Tool Calling
                                p.fs-4.fw-semibold.text-primary.mb-2 你好，我是张楠楠
                                h1.display-4.fw-bolder.mb-4
                                    | 让大模型不仅会回答，
                                    span.text-gradient.d-inline 还能使用工具完成任务
                                p.lead.text-muted.mb-4 数据科学与大数据技术本科生，正在构建面向真实代码仓库的 AI Agent，并持续学习模型接入、工具调用、安全边界与工程测试。
                                .d-grid.gap-3.d-sm-flex.justify-content-sm-center.justify-content-xxl-start.mb-4
                                    a.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg.px-4.py-3.fw-bolder(href='https://github.com/zhangnannanyyds/repo-learning-agent', target='_blank', rel='noreferrer')
                                        i.bi.bi-github.me-2
                                        | 查看 RepoPilot
                                    a.btn.btn-outline-dark.btn-lg.px-4.py-3.fw-bolder(href='projects.html') 浏览项目
                                .d-flex.flex-wrap.justify-content-center.justify-content-xxl-start.gap-2
                                    span.tech-chip OpenAI Agents SDK
                                    span.tech-chip GitHub REST API
                                    span.tech-chip Python unittest
                                    span.tech-chip 安全与隐私控制
                        .col-xxl-6
                            .d-flex.justify-content-center.mt-5.mt-xxl-0
                                .profile.bg-gradient-primary-to-secondary
                                    img.profile-img(src='assets/profile-lively.png', alt='张楠楠个人照片')
                                    .dots-1
                                        include includes/svg-dots.pug
                                    .dots-2
                                        include includes/svg-dots.pug
                                    .dots-3
                                        include includes/svg-dots.pug
                                    .dots-4
                                        include includes/svg-dots.pug

            section.bg-light.py-5
                .container.px-5.py-4
                    .row.gx-5.justify-content-center.mb-5
                        .col-xl-9.text-center
                            p.section-kicker.mb-2 我正在解决的问题
                            h2.display-6.fw-bolder.mb-3
                                span.text-gradient.d-inline 从自然语言到可验证的工具执行
                            p.lead.text-muted.mb-0 我希望 Agent 的回答来自真实文件、真实接口和明确权限，而不是仅靠模型猜测。
                    .row.g-4
                        .col-md-4
                            .capability-card.h-100
                                .feature.bg-primary.bg-gradient-primary-to-secondary.text-white.rounded-3.mb-3
                                    i.bi.bi-diagram-3
                                h3.h5.fw-bolder 工具调用流程
                                p.text-muted.mb-0 将项目分析、文件读取、代码搜索和运行命令推断封装为可审计工具。
                        .col-md-4
                            .capability-card.h-100
                                .feature.bg-primary.bg-gradient-primary-to-secondary.text-white.rounded-3.mb-3
                                    i.bi.bi-shield-check
                                h3.h5.fw-bolder 安全边界
                                p.text-muted.mb-0 通过敏感文件过滤、路径校验、只读权限和外部内容隔离保护本地数据。
                        .col-md-4
                            .capability-card.h-100
                                .feature.bg-primary.bg-gradient-primary-to-secondary.text-white.rounded-3.mb-3
                                    i.bi.bi-check2-square
                                h3.h5.fw-bolder 工程验证
                                p.text-muted.mb-0 使用离线单元测试覆盖异常输入、访问控制、接口失败和关键边界路径。

            section.py-5
                .container.px-5.py-4
                    .featured-project.rounded-4.p-4.p-lg-5
                        .row.align-items-center.g-4
                            .col-lg-8
                                p.section-kicker.mb-2 代表项目
                                h2.fw-bolder.mb-3 RepoPilot 代码仓库学习与调试 Agent
                                p.text-muted.mb-4 支持分析本地项目与 GitHub 仓库，完成项目识别、文件检索、代码读取、报错诊断、历史记录和 Markdown 报告导出。
                                .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2
                                    span.tech-chip Python
                                    span.tech-chip Agents SDK
                                    span.tech-chip GitHub API
                                    span.tech-chip 55 项测试通过
                            .col-lg-4.text-lg-end
                                a.btn.btn-primary.px-4.py-3.fw-bolder(href='https://github.com/zhangnannanyyds/repo-learning-agent', target='_blank', rel='noreferrer') 查看源代码

        include includes/footer.pug
        include includes/scripts.pug
